  "body": "Now the kids have flown the nest, the owners of 83 Riverside Road have already purchased, and this quality Ashcroft home is ready for a new family or savvy investor to snap it up! Solid, spacious and wonderfully practical, this two-level brick and tile home offers the kind of easy family living that makes everyday life a breeze, with plenty of room to spread out, a safe backyard for children and pets, and an incredibly convenient Orewa location. Just a five minute stroll to the beach, shops and estuary walk-ways will make this home a lifestyle choice the whole family will love.\r\n\r\nLocation and easy care brick and tile are the real highlights here. This is a dependable, low maintenance home that will appeal to families and investors alike. Air BnB could also be an excellent option, with the possibilities for short or long term rental offering different income opportunities. Positioned on the flat, you can leave the car at home and walk or cycle to so much of what Orewa has to offer. Families will also appreciate being in the zone for Orewa Beach School and Orewa College, both within easy distance, making the school run a fuss-free start to each day.\r\n\r\nHere are some of the key features we think you'll love:\r\n\r\n- Five bedrooms are thoughtfully arranged over two levels, with one bedroom on the lower level with its own bathroom, offering fantastic options for multi generational living and four on the upper increasing the options for separation.\r\n\r\n- The open-plan kitchen, dining and living area creates a relaxed central hub, with an adjacent office space perfect for working from home.\r\n\r\n- The practical kitchen features easy-care tiled flooring, an island bench and breakfast bar, perfect for casual meals, morning coffee or keeping an eye on homework while dinner is underway\r\n\r\n- Internal shutters on the downstairs windows provide privacy and excellent control of sunlight, while a heat pump keeps the home comfortable throughout the seasons\r\n\r\n- The fully fenced, flat backyard gives children and pets a secure place to play, while the electric gate at the entrance to the shared driveway adds an extra sense of security and peace of mind\r\n\r\n- Solid brick and tile construction makes for low-maintenance living, giving you more time to enjoy the home, the neighbourhood and everything nearby rather than spending weekends on upkeep\r\n\r\n\r\nThe owners have made their plans and are committed to selling, so if you've been looking for a spacious, low-maintenance family home in a location that families will love, 83 Riverside Road deserves to be at the top of your list. \r\n\r\nCome along to the weekends' open homes to see the incredible lifestyle on offer here, or give Tyler Broughton or Emmy Jansen a call for more information.\r\n\r\nOrewa: Auction: 4:00pm, Thursday 19th November 2026 In Rooms, Ray White Orewa, (unless sold prior). You can watch the auction live here https://rwcarpenterrealty.co.nz/watch-our-auctions-live",
